<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">16092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Washington has approved the transfer of forty thousand one-ton bombs to Israel, a package worth two point eight billion dollars and paid for by American taxpayers rather than Israeli purchase.</s> <s>The MK-eighty-four's blast radius runs to hundreds of metres, lethal well beyond a thousand feet in the dense neighbourhoods of Gaza.</s> <s>A fifteen-day congressional review window is now open, and any single senator can force a vote to stop delivery... though none yet has.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Houthi fighters have seized the Yemeni Red Sea port of Mocha and islands near the Bab al-Mandeb strait, and Brent crude jumped three percent to one hundred and nine dollars a barrel.</s> <s>With Hormuz still shut, Saudi Arabia's last two export routes now risk closing together — and a chokepoint like this isn't really a place, it's an insurance market, so the cost arrives as war-risk premiums paid by importers in Egypt, Djibouti and East Africa who never chose a side.</s> <s>Riyadh has twice asked Washington for help and twice been declined.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The director of the <sub alias="F B I">FBI</sub>, Kash Patel, told the Senate Judiciary Committee he's open to sending federal agents to polling places, then reversed himself when a senator pressed him.</s> <s>A Reconstruction-era statute bars armed federal officers from polling places, punishable by up to five years, and it was written precisely because federal troops at the polls had once been used to decide who got to vote.</s> <s>American elections are run by states and counties, so a federal presence has no administrative role available to it — only deterrence.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Secretary of State Marco Rubio has imposed visa restrictions on certain foreign nationals resident in South Africa, naming no individuals in the order.</s> <s>The curb targets officials tied to land reform, race-based policy and Pretoria's genocide case against Israel at the world court — and a visa denial under this provision requires no evidence, no hearing, and faces no judicial review whatsoever.</s> <s>Pretoria hasn't yet said which of its citizens are covered, because nobody has told it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In the Wazir subdivision of Bannu district, a quadcopter killed two civilians and injured two more.</s> <s>Pakistani police blame armed militants, while residents in neighbouring districts have blamed security forces for similar strikes — and a machine that costs a few hundred dollars needs no airstrip and leaves no signature.</s> <s>When a weapon gets cheap enough that attribution becomes impossible, a family loses not only protection but the ability to name who killed them.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mahmoud Khalil, who spent one hundred and four days in a Louisiana jail over campus protests, has sued Columbia University for failing to protect Palestinian, Arab and Muslim students from harassment.</s> <s>His complaint invokes Title Six, the same civil-rights statute the administration used to press universities into disciplining pro-Palestinian students — turned now in the opposite direction.</s> <s>Because that law conditions federal funding on non-discrimination, the remedy isn't damages... it's leverage over a university's money.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Iran's mission in Vienna has won a seat on the General Committee of the International Atomic Energy Agency's general conference.</s> <s>The committee sets the agenda and the order of business, which means Tehran now helps decide how its own nuclear file is discussed — a small procedural power, but a real one.</s> <s>Iran's mission said member states rejected American objections to the appointment.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Giza, Egyptian police found thirty-three Sudanese men sleeping in a public park, and all thirty-three now face deportation.</s> <s>Sudanese firms in Cairo stopped paying wages and then stopped paying for housing as Sudan's economy collapsed, and those jobs were what anchored the men's legal residency.</s> <s>Separately, the American envoy Massad Boulos conceded from Dubai that Washington's Sudan roadmap has failed, and that neither warring general has a political future.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A twenty-one-year-old Spanish exchange student was stabbed to death in Morelos state, and Mexican prosecutors are investigating it as femicide.</s> <s>Femicide is a distinct legal category in Mexico, created with a higher sentence and a mandatory investigative protocol because homicide cases involving women were routinely closed unexamined.</s> <s>Morelos has logged twenty-one femicides this year — and the honest test is whether the families of the other twenty get the same protocol a foreign minister's demand produces.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The United States House of Representatives advanced a Russia sanctions bill by just three votes, opening the door to one hundred percent tariffs on India, China and other buyers of Russian oil.</s> <s>Countries importing under fifteen percent of their gas from Russia, and cutting further, would be exempt — which makes the bill less a punishment of Moscow than a sorting mechanism for everyone who trades with it.</s> <s>A final vote is still to come.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's consumer price index reached one hundred and forty-six point three points last month, and the headline inflation rate barely moved.</s> <s>Underneath it, monthly food inflation collapsed to one point zero two percent from five point five six, while core inflation turned negative — two things a single national figure completely hides.</s> <s>The central bank now has to decide which of those numbers it believes.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A crypto market-structure bill collapsed in the American Senate and Bitcoin fell five percent.</s> <s>The failure leaves financial regulators, rather than elected legislators, writing the rules — and the dispute that sank it was ethical, centring on the one point four billion dollars the president earned from crypto ventures last year.</s> <s>Its sponsor says she'll bring it back.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan begins a fuel subsidy at midnight Wednesday, taking one hundred rupees off each litre for motorcycle and rickshaw owners, capped at twenty to thirty litres a month.</s> <s>It's funded by the very levy the state already charges on fuel — money taken from drivers at the pump and returned to a narrower set of them.</s> <s>Whether the central bank can repay filling stations on schedule will decide if the relief survives its first month, God willing.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>At the Anyiin displacement camp in Benue State, a woman paid out of her own pocket for micronutrient supplements that policy says are free.</s> <s>Médecins Sans Frontières ran the camp clinic until funding lapsed in twenty twenty-one, and the state's role stayed supervisory — so humanitarian health in Nigeria's Middle Belt is short donor cycles laid over a system that was never rebuilt.</s> <s>Displaced mothers there are now skipping antenatal care entirely, which is how maternal anaemia and low birth weight arrive.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Wild chimpanzees in Senegal hand tools to youngsters — and, decisively, they do it for the difficult techniques and not the easy ones.</s> <s>Teaching has a behavioural definition: a cost to the giver, a naive observer, and faster learning for the receiver, criteria long held to be uniquely human.</s> <s>Selectivity is what makes this a finding rather than an anecdote, because a technique that must be reinvented each generation can never accumulate.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Britain's statutory climate advisers say flying could account for eighty percent of remaining <sub alias="U K">UK</sub> emissions by twenty fifty.</s> <s>That's a denominator problem, not a growth problem: electricity, heating and road transport are decarbonising while jet fuel has no substitute at scale, so aviation's share climbs even if aviation doesn't.</s> <s>Ministers face a Heathrow expansion decision shortly, in a world where most people have never boarded a plane at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An unvaccinated eighteen-year-old has died of measles complications in Pennsylvania, the fourth death in an outbreak now at six hundred and ninety-three cases — the state's worst in three decades.</s> <s>Measles spreads more easily than almost any other virus, which is why herd immunity demands roughly ninety-five percent coverage and collapses quickly below it.</s> <s>Brazil, meanwhile, now chairs the body deciding which carbon credits the world will accept, with modelling suggesting coordinated prices across twenty-one countries could cut emissions sevenfold.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A Soviet-era physics programme left Lithuania with a world-leading femtosecond laser industry, and those lasers now cut and anneal the silicon wafers that Taiwan's fabs depend on.</s> <s>Everyone can name the giant Dutch lithography firm; almost nobody can name the handful of small Lithuanian companies whose disappearance would idle a chip plant.</s> <s>Beijing removed Lithuania from its customs system after Vilnius admitted a Taiwanese office in twenty twenty-one — a tested case of what coercion costs a small open economy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Britain's National Cyber Security Centre says Iranian state operators phished exiled critics using fake <sub alias="M R I">MRI</sub> results.</s> <s>Choosing a medical document means the operators already held the target's health data — so spearphishing is a reconnaissance problem long before it's a technical one, and no spam filter answers it.</s> <s>Norway, for its part, is investigating whether Telenor's dealings with Myanmar's military enabled crimes, while itself remaining the company's controlling shareholder.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Larry Ellison has pledged three hundred and forty-six million Oracle shares, worth fifty billion dollars, against loans.</s> <s>Borrowing against stock instead of selling it avoids capital gains tax, but a steep drop can force lenders to sell into the fall — and Oracle already carries tens of billions in debt raised for artificial intelligence.</s> <s>Thousands of Oracle employees have been laid off while that structure was assembled.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Ashburn, researchers have executed a complete fruit-fly brain as running code — one hundred and sixty-six thousand seven hundred real neurons, the first whole animal brain ever run this way.</s> <s>A connectome maps the wiring but not the synaptic weights or timing that made the living fly behave, so this is anatomy in motion rather than a mind.</s> <s>It does allow the first synaptic-resolution comparison between the sexes of a species.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>